1150
01:12:35.480 --> 01:12:37.480 align:middle
<c.yellow>Da habe ich das Gefühl,</c>
<c.yellow>dass er mauert.</c>

1151
01:12:37.760 --> 01:12:39.720 align:middle
<c.yellow>Völlig abwegig.</c>

1152
01:12:43.560 --> 01:12:46.240 align:middle
